{'symbol': 'SNPS', 'date': '2021-10-12 09:05:00', 'title': "SYNOPSYS AND DASSAULT SYSTÈMES PARTNER TO ENABLE INDUSTRY'S FIRST HOLISTIC LIGHTING DESIGN PLATFORM", 'text': 'MOUNTAIN VIEW, CALIF. AND VELIZY-VILLACOUBLAY, FRANCE, OCT. 12, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SYNOPSYS, INC.\xa0(NASDAQ:\xa0SNPS) AND DASSAULT SYSTÈMES (EURONEXT PARIS: FR0014003TT8, DSY.PA) TODAY ANNOUNCED THEIR PARTNERSHIP TO INTEGRATE SYNOPSYS OPTICAL DESIGN SOLUTIONS INTO THE DASSAULT SYSTÈMES 3DEXPERIENCE PLATFORM TO FACILITATE THE DEVELOPMENT OF SAFER, SMARTER VEHICLES.'}